  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/IMG_3699.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(24 fotos) El teatro M&oacute;naco de Onda se ha llenado este s&aacute;bado de p&uacute;blico, especialmente infantil y familiar, para ver Pinocho, un musical para so&ntilde;ar,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/pinocho6.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px;\" /></p>\n<p>de Trencad&iacute;s Produccions, dirigido por Jos&eacute; Tom&agrave;s Ch&agrave;fer, con texto y letras de Josep Moll&agrave;, y m&uacute;sica original de Francis J.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_3699.jpg\" alt=\"img_3699\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_3702.jpg\" alt=\"img_3702\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_3703.jpg\" alt=\"img_3703\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_3704.jpg\" alt=\"img_3704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_3705.jpg\" alt=\"img_3705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_3706.jpg\" alt=\"img_3706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_3707.jpg\" alt=\"img_3707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pinotxomusicalalmonaco100218/img_370